    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.poster.avif?t=1743697413\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.webm?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.mp4?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>HostageHub</strong>, the ultimate hostage-rescue-gig-economy experience! Your objective is simple: eliminate the baddies, rescue the hostage, earn cash, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship is forged in the flames of hostage rescue. Team up with up to 5 other players to bring the hostages home (or, if you have no friends, you can go it solo, we won't judge).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight slowly and calculated, or go in guns blazing? A bit of both may be required to take on your adversaries. But hey, just remember the number one rule of hostage rescue - have fun!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more hostages you rescue, the more powerful your enemies get. And the more money you earn for upgrades. Funny how that works, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn to Progress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to purchase an arsenal of weapons, gear, and power-ups to keep you one step ahead of the baddies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Budgeting</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns and ammo ain't cheap! Balancing your budget is crucial to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.poster.avif?t=1743697413\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.webm?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.mp4?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HostageHub\u00a0</strong>is calling on<i> you</i>\u00a0to bring the boys back home \u2013 will you rise to the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.poster.avif?t=1743697413\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.webm?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/58ae295d47567fdc35c440475c5ea450.mp4?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>HostageHub</strong>, the ultimate hostage-rescue-gig-economy experience! Your objective is simple: eliminate the baddies, rescue the hostage, earn cash, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship is forged in the flames of hostage rescue. Team up with up to 5 other players to bring the hostages home (or, if you have no friends, you can go it solo, we won't judge).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight slowly and calculated, or go in guns blazing? A bit of both may be required to take on your adversaries. But hey, just remember the number one rule of hostage rescue - have fun!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more hostages you rescue, the more powerful your enemies get. And the more money you earn for upgrades. Funny how that works, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn to Progress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to purchase an arsenal of weapons, gear, and power-ups to keep you one step ahead of the baddies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Budgeting</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns and ammo ain't cheap! Balancing your budget is crucial to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.poster.avif?t=1743697413\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.webm?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/f06b9d77ec2869bc7602697ead7c721b.mp4?t=1743697413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HostageHub\u00a0</strong>is calling on<i> you</i>\u00a0to bring the boys back home \u2013 will you rise to the challenge?</p>",
